codex
The smallest viable design is one optional `promptCacheKeyUnsupportedModels` array in the existing V6 stats JSON. Parsing will normalize missing or malformed values to an empty list, so all prior state versions remain safe. The extension will union that list with the current closure set and synchronously flush only on a newly learned rejection, preserving default-on injection for every model not in the per-model list.
