codex
The regression coverage now exercises the real lifecycle: it records a matching 400, verifies the existing state file contains only that model, creates a fresh module instance, runs `session_start`, and proves that model is skipped while an untouched model still receives the key. A separate test loads a pre-change V6 file without the field and asserts the normalized learned set is empty. I’m running the focused suite now.
